            `InvalidKey`-for-size path is either gone with no ending lost, or still has a real reason, logged. Entity
            caps (record queue 64, given-up marks) are Plan-only until EntityDomains is built; they are dropped from the
            Plans by D24's merge, not built here. No Spec keeps a gap as a limit.

