            `packages/flow-state-v3/tests/rules/reloads.ts` and `tests/rules/sweep.ts`, `src/host/testing/`.

            **Risk:** a cut that misses part of the world (fake servers, the store, the clock, open calls) gives a
            different run and silently weakens the sweep. Both forms run over every fixture Story and compare verdicts
            before the replay form is switched off; the replay form is kept, disabled, so it can be turned back on (the
            user, 2026-11-18).

